            },
          ]
        }
      >
        investor
      </Text>
      , your
       
      <Text
        style={
          [
            {
              "color": "#1c1c1e",
              "fontWeight": "700",
            },
            {
              "color": "#fff",
            },
          ]
        }
      >
        VP
      </Text>
      . No laptop. No time to redo it. And Gmail mangles every dark-mode paste — white text on white background, colors trashed. Not a great look when stakes are high.
    </Text>
  </View>
</View>
`;

